# enisa-rag-agent

Python scraping + RAG project.

## Language
- Python 3.11+; use type hints everywhere.

## HTTP
- All HTTP calls go through `scraper/fetcher.py` only.

## Scraper / metadata
- Metadata state lives in `enisa_docs/metadata.json` — never re-download if `uid` exists.

## RAG
- RAG logic lives in `rag/` only — do not mix with the scraper.

## URLs
- No hardcoded URLs outside `config.py`.

## New sites
- When adding new sites, add a new fetcher class; do not modify the ENISA fetcher.
